Subject: [PATCH 052/128] feat: add link rewrite presets

Add compatible enabled and first/random domain rules with tele presets.

Constraint: Preserve existing Android rewrite storage and paste behavior

Rejected: Port automatic preview modes in this patch | Android paste provenance and manual preview lifecycle need separate hooks

Confidence: medium

Scope-risk: moderate

Not-tested: Manual preset selection and pasted-link rewrite on device
